RENDEZ-VOUS IN PARIS – The 5th edition is coming!\
\
“I just wanna tell…. Something good…”\
\
📅 June 18–21, 2026\
\
🌍 Join us for an unforgettable experience\
\
🛼 Get your skates ready and be part of the adventure!\
\
🚨 Stay until June 22: La Fête de la Musique will take place this year on Sunday evening, June 21, and it will be unforgettable! 🚨\
\
Everyone is welcome, whether you are a beginner or experienced — you’re simply here to feel the vibe. 🙌\
\
Stay tuned, more information coming soon 🤩
